  <p>In the meantime, please explore the <a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/">Dasher Manual</a> for comprehensive information about using Dasher.</p>

  <h2>Advanced Topics</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part3/">Personalizing Dasher</a> - Customizing your Dasher experience</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part6/">Continuous Gestures</a> - Advanced input methods</li>
